# Grouping a task from one project with a task from another under a new heading puts the group where the first was, and one undo takes the whole group back apart.
file <<END
Work:
	- Report
		Draft due Friday
	- Slides
Home:
	- Laundry
	- Groceries
		- Milk
		- Eggs
END
keys j j j v j j v gG
type Mixed
keys <Esc>
see ▌   Mixed
see       - Laundry
saved <<END
Work:
	- Report
		Draft due Friday
	Mixed
		- Slides
		- Laundry
Home:
	- Groceries
		- Milk
		- Eggs
END
keys z
hide Mixed
quit
saved <<END
Work:
	- Report
		Draft due Friday
	- Slides
Home:
	- Laundry
	- Groceries
		- Milk
		- Eggs
END
